          "id": 3430459792,
          "type": "DiscussionNote",
          "body": "The goal of this MR was to have CMake installer match the NSIS installer because I'd like to modernize the WiX installer (for .msi) where the latest versions (4 and 5) use CMake/CPack (so CMake/CPack should equal functionality of NSIS).\nIt sounds like we want to move to removing translation files from (all) installations, but if there are platforms that still want it, I'd prefer that be done in CMake files, even if there is a \"#ifdef Windows\" around it.",
